 "nl": [
  "Hosts in hr may reach database over SSH (TCP 22).",
  "ops is isolated: it may only reach library on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in database may reach student-lab over SSH (TCP 22) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Permit any TCP port from iot-sensors to admin but deny FTP (TCP 21).",
  "Apart from ops on syslog (UDP 514); database on DNS over UDP 53, all traffic originating in printers must be dropped.",
  "ops must never reach printers, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Hosts in database may reach ops over PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "hr offers HTTPS (TCP 443) and DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "admin must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and HTTPS (TCP 443) from cameras.",
  "Allow mail to connect to iot-sensors using HTTP (TCP 80) and RDP (TCP 3389) and SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "database is isolated: it may only reach library on HTTPS (TCP 443); cameras on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in cameras may reach ops over RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Hosts in cameras may reach student-lab over DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "No packet from cameras may enter hr, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Any zone may connect to student-lab over NTP (UDP 123).",
  "student-lab is isolated: it may only reach printers on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "Permit any TCP port from admin to printers but deny Telnet (TCP 23), FTP (TCP 21).",
  "Hosts in cameras may reach hr over RDP (TCP 3389) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "admin must accept SMTP (TCP 25) from printers.",
  "Deny all traffic from admin to student-lab (this overrides any public service).",
  "Allow ops to connect to printers using LDAP (TCP 389) and SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "Block RDP (TCP 3389), PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), MySQL (TCP 3306) from database to student-lab; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "student-lab must accept SMTP (TCP 25) and HTTP (TCP 80) and RTSP (TCP 554) from ops.",
  "mail offers NTP (UDP 123) and HTTP (TCP 80) to every zone.",
  "admin must accept DNS over UDP 53 and NTP (UDP 123) from ops.",
  "Hosts in iot-sensors may reach ops over SMB (TCP 445) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "printers must accept NTP (UDP 123) and LDAP (TCP 389) from library.",
  "library must accept DNS over UDP 53 and RDP (TCP 3389) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from iot-sensors.",
  "cameras offers HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) to every zone.",
  "library must accept SMTP (TCP 25) from database."
 ],
